    "body": "A spacecraft of mass $\\textbf{300 kg}$ is in outer space at location $\\langle 1.00, 1.00, 2.00 \\rangle\\,\\text{m}$ and moving with an initial speed of $\\textbf{3.00 m/s}$. One set of thrusters exerts a constant force $\\langle 100, 200, 200 \\rangle\\,\\text{N}$ until the spacecraft reaches\nlocation $\\langle 2.00, 2.00, 3.00 \\rangle\\,\\text{m}$. At this point, these thrusters are turned off, and another set of thrusters are turned on which exert a constant force $\\langle 200, 200, 200\\rangle\\,\\text{N}$ until the space craft reaches location $\\langle 3.00, 3.00, 4.00 \\rangle\\,\\text{m}$. \n\nWhat is the \\textbf{speed} of the space craft at the \\textit{final} location? \\textbf{Select the closest answer}.",
